# Implementation Plan: Bucket K — Event RSVP System

Convert **Utsav** from event discovery into full **event participation** by introducing a multi-tenant, role-aware Event RSVP & Passbook system.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The Event RSVP system adheres strictly to the existing **multi-tenant isolation** rules (`collegeId` boundary verified server-side), **JWT authentication middleware**, and **role system** (`student`, `faculty`, `admin`).
> We will follow **TDD (Test-Driven Development)**: writing tests first in `backend/src/test/rsvp.test.ts` before implementing models, controllers, and routes.

