### 3. Backend Implementation (`backend/src/`)

#### [NEW] [eventRsvp.model.ts](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Desktop/PROJECT%20CREATED/campushub/backend/src/models/eventRsvp.model.ts)
- Define `eventRsvpSchema` with:
  - `eventId`: ObjectId (ref: "Event", required, indexed)
  - `userId`: ObjectId (ref: "User", required, indexed)
  - `collegeId`: ObjectId (ref: "College", required, indexed)
  - `status`: `"confirmed" | "cancelled"` (default: `"confirmed"`)
  - `ticketNumber`: String (unique ticket format e.g. `PASS-{eventId.slice(-4)}-{random}`)
  - `createdAt`, `updatedAt` timestamps
- Indexes: `{ eventId: 1, userId: 1 }` (unique), `{ userId: 1, collegeId: 1, status: 1 }`, `{ eventId: 1, status: 1 }`.

#### [NEW] [rsvpController.ts](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Desktop/PROJECT%20CREATED/campushub/backend/src/controllers/rsvpController.ts)
- `createOrUpdateRsvp`: Validates event exists, is future, belongs to user's college, and matches department visibility. Creates or activates RSVP with unique ticket.
- `cancelRsvp`: Marks RSVP status as `cancelled`.
- `getMyRsvps`: Lists user's active confirmed event passes populated with event metadata.
- `getEventAttendees`: Accessible to admins and event creator faculty to view attendee list.

#### [MODIFY] [eventRoutes.ts](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Desktop/PROJECT%20CREATED/campushub/backend/src/routes/eventRoutes.ts)
