- Verify existing regression suites in `event.test.ts`, `admin.test.ts`, `auth.test.ts` remain 100% green.

### Manual Verification
- Log in as Student -> browse `/events` -> click "RSVP Pass" -> verify ticket created and attendee count increments.
- Navigate to `/passes` -> verify confirmed event pass appears in Passbook with unique ticket number.
- Log in as Faculty/Admin -> verify attendee list shows student registration in `/admin/events`.
- Click "Cancel RSVP" -> verify pass removed from Passbook and attendee count decrements.
